# Environments
# .env alone matched ONLY the exact filename. A timestamped backup written
# during secret rotation (.env.backup-20260802-134451) contained every secret
# in the project, including ones already known-leaked, and was fully
# committable. Any derivative of .env is a copy of the secrets.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
.venv
env/
venv/
