# ── Local-only working material ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repository is the BACKEND. The agentorc.ca site assets, the CRM data
# exports and the deploy scripts are local working files that happen to share
# a folder with it. None were ignored, so a single `git add -A` would have
# published 281 MB of images and a directory of contact/account CSVs.
# Selective staging is not a control; this is.
